{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22258","headline":"邓州路中作 · 白居易","name":"邓州路中作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萧萧谁家村，秋棃叶半坼。\n漠漠谁家园，秋韭花初白。\n路逢故里物，使我嗟行役。\n不归渭北村，又作江南客。\n去乡徒自苦，济世终无益。\n自问波上萍，何如涧中石。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22258.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22258","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}